  "design": "Require independently pinned runtime and SDK PDFium RPMs, exact immutable fixture inventory, installed native/provider path agreement, renderer enforcement, image/font prerequisites and unprivileged execution. SDK compiles the existing C API consumer through installed pkg-config and runs it normally and under Valgrind with no suppressions. Runtime excludes development headers and compiler.",
